==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Bearkini]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Most midrangers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] can outrange Bearkini and beat the stage quickly with proper meatshielding.

